<!-- 主窗口：自绘标题栏 + 左侧导航 + 圆角内容层（首页 / 版本列表 / 下载任务 / 下载目录 / 设置）。
     事件在 MainController 中按 x:Name 绑定。 -->
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="MC 原版下载器" Width="1200" Height="780" MinWidth="980" MinHeight="640"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        Background="{DynamicResource WindowBg}" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextPrimary}"
        FontFamily="{StaticResource UiFont}" FontSize="13"
        TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Display" UseLayoutRounding="True">
    <WindowChrome.WindowChrome>
        <WindowChrome CaptionHeight="44" ResizeBorderThickness="6" GlassFrameThickness="0,0,0,1"
                      CornerRadius="0" UseAeroCaptionButtons="False"/>
    </WindowChrome.WindowChrome>

    <Border x:Name="RootBorder" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource LayerBorder}">
        <Grid>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="232"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="44"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

            <!-- ===== 侧边栏 ===== -->
            <Grid Grid.RowSpan="2">
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="60"/>
                    <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="20,10,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Border Width="32" Height="32" CornerRadius="8" Background="{DynamicResource HeroBg}">
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE7B8;" FontSize="16" Foreground="White"/>
                    </Border>
                    <StackPanel Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="MC 原版下载器" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="Mojang · BMCLAPI" FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>

                <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="10,22,10,0">
                    <RadioButton x:Name="NavHome" Style="{StaticResource NavItem}" Tag="&#xE80F;" Content="首页" IsChecked="True"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="NavVersions" Style="{StaticResource NavItem}" Tag="&#xE8F1;" Content="版本列表"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="NavDownloads" Style="{StaticResource NavItem}" Tag="&#xE896;">
                        <Grid>
                            <TextBlock Text="下载任务" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            <Border HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" MinWidth="20" Height="20" CornerRadius="10"
                                    Padding="6,0" Background="{DynamicResource Accent}"
                                    Visibility="{Binding ActiveBadgeVisible, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding ActiveBadge}" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextOnAccent}"
                                           HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            </Border>
                        </Grid>
                    </RadioButton>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="NavFiles" Style="{StaticResource NavItem}" Tag="&#xE8B7;" Content="下载目录"/>
                </StackPanel>

                <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="10,0,10,14">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource DividerLine}" Margin="8,0,8,10"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="NavSettings" Style="{StaticResource NavItem}" Tag="&#xE713;" Content="设置"/>
                </StackPanel>
            </Grid>

            <!-- ===== 标题栏按钮 ===== -->
            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                <Button x:Name="BtnMin" Style="{StaticResource CaptionButton}" Content="&#xE921;" ToolTip="最小化"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnMax" Style="{StaticResource CaptionButton}" Content="&#xE922;" ToolTip="最大化"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnClose" Style="{StaticResource CloseCaptionButton}" Content="&#xE8BB;" ToolTip="关闭"/>
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- ===== 内容层 ===== -->
            <Border Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Background="{DynamicResource LayerBg}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource LayerBorder}"
                    BorderThickness="1,1,0,0" CornerRadius="10,0,0,0">
                <Grid x:Name="PageHost">

                    <!-- ========== 首页 ========== -->
                    <ScrollViewer x:Name="PageHome" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                        <StackPanel Margin="40,32,40,40">
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="首页"/>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSubtitle}" Text="下载 Minecraft 原版客户端 client.jar，同时支持 Mojang 官方源与 BMCLAPI 国内镜像"/>

                            <Border x:Name="Hero" Margin="0,24,0,0" Height="196" CornerRadius="14" Background="{DynamicResource HeroBg}">
                                <Grid>
                                    <Ellipse Width="300" Height="300" Fill="#14FFFFFF" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,-110,-70,0"/>
                                    <Ellipse Width="190" Height="190" Fill="#10FFFFFF" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="0,0,170,-110"/>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE7B8;" FontSize="108" Foreground="#30FFFFFF"
                                               HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,64,0"/>
                                    <StackPanel Margin="34,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <TextBlock Text="最新正式版" Foreground="#D9FFFFFF" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding LatestRelease}" Foreground="White" FontSize="36" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding LatestReleaseDetail}" Foreground="#D9FFFFFF" FontSize="13" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                                            <Button x:Name="HeroDownload" Style="{StaticResource HeroButton}" IsEnabled="{Binding CanDownloadRelease}">
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE896;" FontSize="14"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="立即下载" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </Button>
                                            <Button x:Name="HeroBrowse" Style="{StaticResource HeroGhostButton}" Content="浏览全部版本" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Grid>
                            </Border>

                            <Grid>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="版本源"/>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnReload" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                                        Margin="0,0,0,8" IsEnabled="{Binding CanReload}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE72C;" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="重新获取清单" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </Grid>
                            <UniformGrid Columns="2">
                                <ContentControl Content="{Binding Mojang}" ContentTemplate="{StaticResource SourceCard}" Margin="0,0,8,0" Focusable="False"/>
                                <ContentControl Content="{Binding Bmclapi}" ContentTemplate="{StaticResource SourceCard}" Margin="8,0,0,0" Focusable="False"/>
                            </UniformGrid>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="版本统计"/>
                            <ItemsControl x:Name="StatsList" ItemsSource="{Binding Stats}" Margin="-6,0" Focusable="False">
                                <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsPanelTemplate><UniformGrid Columns="5"/></ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    <DataTemplate>
                                        <Button Style="{StaticResource CardButton}" Tag="{Binding Type}" Margin="6,0" ToolTip="在版本列表中查看">
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <Border Style="{StaticResource TypeTag}" Tag="{Binding Type}" Width="34" Height="34" Padding="0" CornerRadius="9">
                                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="{Binding Glyph}" FontSize="15"/>
                                                </Border>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Count}" FontSize="26" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Label}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Button>
                                    </DataTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="快捷操作"/>
                            <UniformGrid Columns="2">
                                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,0,8,0">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource TypeTag}" Tag="snapshot" Width="40" Height="40" Padding="0" CornerRadius="10">
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE945;" FontSize="17"/>
                                        </Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding LatestSnapshot}" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding LatestSnapshotDetail}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnSnapshot" Grid.Column="2" Content="下载" IsEnabled="{Binding CanDownloadSnapshot}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>
                                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="8,0,0,0">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}">
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8B7;" FontSize="17"/>
                                        </Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="下载目录" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding OutDir}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding OutDir}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Button x:Name="BtnHomeOpenDir" Grid.Column="2" Content="打开"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>
                            </UniformGrid>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>

                    <!-- ========== 版本列表 ========== -->
                    <Grid x:Name="PageVersions" Margin="40,32,40,28" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Grid>
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="版本列表"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSubtitle}" Text="{Binding VersionSummary}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnClearSelection" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" Content="清空选择" IsEnabled="{Binding HasSelection}"/>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnDownloadSelected" Style="{StaticResource AccentButton}" Margin="8,0,0,0" MinHeight="34" IsEnabled="{Binding HasSelection}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE896;" FontSize="14"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding DownloadSelectedText}" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <Grid Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,22,0,0">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Grid>
                                <TextBox x:Name="SearchBox" Tag="搜索版本号，例如 1.20.1、24w14potato" Padding="36,0,36,0" MinHeight="38"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE721;" FontSize="14" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="13,0,0,0"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnClearSearch" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE711;" FontSize="11" Width="28" Height="28"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,5,0" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="清除"/>
                            </Grid>
                            <Border Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource SegmentHost}" Margin="12,0,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                    <RadioButton x:Name="SrcAll" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Src" Tag="all" Content="全部源" IsChecked="True" MinHeight="32"/>
                                    <RadioButton x:Name="SrcMojang" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Src" Tag="mojang" Content="Mojang"/>
                                    <RadioButton x:Name="SrcBmclapi" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Src" Tag="bmclapi" Content="BMCLAPI"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </Grid>

                        <Grid Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                            <WrapPanel x:Name="TypeChips" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="all" Content="全部" IsChecked="True"/>
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="release" Content="正式版"/>
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="snapshot" Content="预览版"/>
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="april" Content="愚人节"/>
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="old_alpha" Content="早期 Alpha"/>
                                <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Chip}" GroupName="Type" Tag="old_beta" Content="早期 Beta"/>
                            </WrapPanel>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <Button x:Name="BtnSelectVisible" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" Content="全选当前列表"/>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnUnselectVisible" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" Content="全不选"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,16,0,0" Padding="6">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <Grid Margin="12,8,24,6" TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}" TextElement.FontSize="12">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="34"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="120"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="160"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="36"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="版本"/>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="类型"/>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="发布日期"/>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="可用源"/>
                                </Grid>
                                <ItemsControl x:Name="VersionList" Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource VirtualList}" ItemsSource="{Binding Versions}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <ToggleButton Style="{StaticResource ListRow}" IsChecked="{Binding IsChecked, Mode=TwoWay}">
                                                <Grid>
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="34"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="120"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="160"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="36"/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <CheckBox IsChecked="{Binding IsChecked, Mode=OneWay}" IsHitTestVisible="False" Focusable="False" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Id}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                                                    <Border Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource TypeTag}" Tag="{Binding Type}">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding TypeLabel}"/>
                                                    </Border>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="{Binding Date}" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="4" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource SourceBadge}" Margin="0,0,6,0"
                                                                Visibility="{Binding HasMojang, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                                            <TextBlock Text="Mojang"/>
                                                        </Border>
                                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource SourceBadge}"
                                                                Visibility="{Binding HasBmclapi, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                                            <TextBlock Text="BMCLAPI"/>
                                                        </Border>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                    <Button Grid.Column="5" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE896;" Tag="{Binding Id}"
                                                            ToolTip="只下载这个版本" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </ToggleButton>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>

                                <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Visibility="{Binding IsLoading, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                    <ContentControl ContentTemplate="{StaticResource Spinner}" Focusable="False" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="正在获取版本清单…" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,14,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Visibility="{Binding VersionsEmpty, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE721;" FontSize="32" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="没有符合条件的版本" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,14,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="换个关键字或筛选条件试试" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- ========== 下载任务 ========== -->
                    <Grid x:Name="PageDownloads" Margin="40,32,40,28" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Grid>
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="下载任务"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSubtitle}" Text="{Binding DownloadSubtitle}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Button x:Name="BtnDownloadsOpenDir" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE838;" FontSize="14"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="打开下载目录" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Button>
                        </Grid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,22,0,0" Padding="24,20">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <StackPanel MinWidth="92" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding TotalPercentText}" FontSize="34" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="总进度" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="24,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <ProgressBar Value="{Binding TotalPercent}" Maximum="100" Height="8"/>
                                    <Grid Margin="0,12,0,0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding TotalDetail}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding TotalSpeedText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Pill}"><TextBlock Text="{Binding ConcurrencyText}"/></Border>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Pill}" Margin="6,0,0,0"><TextBlock Text="{Binding PriorityText}"/></Border>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <Button x:Name="BtnDownloadSettings" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" Content="下载设置" HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                            Margin="0,8,-8,0" MinHeight="28" Foreground="{DynamicResource AccentText}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>

                        <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,16,0,0" Padding="6">
                            <Grid>
                                <ItemsControl x:Name="TaskList" Style="{StaticResource VirtualList}" ItemsSource="{Binding Tasks}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Grid Height="68" Margin="12,0">
                                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="48"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <Border Width="36" Height="36" CornerRadius="18" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                                    <Border.Style>
                                                        <Style TargetType="Border">
                                                            <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource SubtleSelected}"/>
                                                            <Setter Property="TextElement.Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}"/>
                                                            <Style.Triggers>
                                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="run">
                                                                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AccentSubtle}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Property="TextElement.Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AccentText}"/>
                                                                </DataTrigger>
                                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="done">
                                                                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource SuccessSubtle}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Property="TextElement.Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Success}"/>
                                                                </DataTrigger>
                                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="fail">
                                                                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource DangerSubtle}"/>
                                                                    <Setter Property="TextElement.Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Danger}"/>
                                                                </DataTrigger>
                                                            </Style.Triggers>
                                                        </Style>
                                                    </Border.Style>
                                                    <TextBlock FontSize="15">
                                                        <TextBlock.Style>
                                                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Icon}">
                                                                <Setter Property="Text" Value="&#xE917;"/>
                                                                <Style.Triggers>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="run"><Setter Property="Text" Value="&#xE896;"/></DataTrigger>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="done"><Setter Property="Text" Value="&#xE73E;"/></DataTrigger>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="fail"><Setter Property="Text" Value="&#xE711;"/></DataTrigger>
                                                                </Style.Triggers>
                                                            </Style>
                                                        </TextBlock.Style>
                                                    </TextBlock>
                                                </Border>
                                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Vid}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource SourceBadge}" Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                                                Visibility="{Binding HasSource, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Source}"/>
                                                        </Border>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                    <ProgressBar Value="{Binding Percent}" Maximum="100" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                                        <ProgressBar.Style>
                                                            <Style TargetType="ProgressBar" BasedOn="{StaticResource {x:Type ProgressBar}}">
                                                                <Style.Triggers>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="done">
                                                                        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Success}"/>
                                                                    </DataTrigger>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding State}" Value="fail">
                                                                        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Danger}"/>
                                                                    </DataTrigger>
                                                                </Style.Triggers>
                                                            </Style>
                                                        </ProgressBar.Style>
                                                    </ProgressBar>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,6,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding Status}"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding PercentText}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" MinWidth="56"
                                                           TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}"/>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>

                                <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Visibility="{Binding NoTasks, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                    <Border Width="72" Height="72" CornerRadius="36" Background="{DynamicResource AccentSubtle}">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE896;" FontSize="28" Foreground="{DynamicResource AccentText}"/>
                                    </Border>
                                    <TextBlock Text="暂无下载任务" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,18,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="在「版本列表」中勾选版本，然后点击「下载所选」" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,6,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <Button x:Name="BtnGoVersions" Style="{StaticResource AccentButton}" Content="前往版本列表" Margin="0,20,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- ========== 下载目录 ========== -->
                    <Grid x:Name="PageFiles" Margin="40,32,40,28" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Grid>
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="下载目录"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSubtitle}" Text="显示下载目录中最多 4 层的文件与子目录"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                                <Button x:Name="BtnRefreshFiles" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE72C;" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="刷新" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnFilesOpenDir" Style="{StaticResource SubtleButton}" Margin="4,0,0,0">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8A7;" FontSize="13"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="在资源管理器中打开" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,22,0,0" Padding="20,16">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}">
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8B7;" FontSize="17"/>
                                </Border>
                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock Text="当前目录" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding OutDir}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,2,0,0"
                                               TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding OutDir}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Button x:Name="BtnFilesChangeDir" Grid.Column="2" Content="更改…"/>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>

                        <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,16,0,0" Padding="8">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <Grid Margin="40,6,30,6" TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}" TextElement.FontSize="12">
                                    <TextBlock Text="名称"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="大小" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                                </Grid>
                                <TreeView x:Name="FileTree" Grid.Row="1" ItemsSource="{Binding Files}" Padding="0,0,6,0">
                                    <TreeView.ItemTemplate>
                                        <HierarchicalDataTemplate ItemsSource="{Binding Children}">
                                            <Grid>
                                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Glyph}" FontSize="15">
                                                    <TextBlock.Style>
                                                        <Style TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Icon}">
                                                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}"/>
                                                            <Style.Triggers>
                                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsDir}" Value="True">
                                                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AccentText}"/>
                                                                </DataTrigger>
                                                            </Style.Triggers>
                                                        </Style>
                                                    </TextBlock.Style>
                                                </TextBlock>
                                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Name}" Margin="10,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding Size}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </HierarchicalDataTemplate>
                                    </TreeView.ItemTemplate>
                                </TreeView>
                                <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Visibility="{Binding FilesEmpty, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8B7;" FontSize="32" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="目录为空或不存在" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,14,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="下载完成的 client.jar 会出现在这里" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- ========== 设置 ========== -->
                    <ScrollViewer x:Name="PageSettings" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <StackPanel Margin="40,32,40,40">
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="设置"/>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSubtitle}" Text="修改会立即生效并自动保存"/>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="下载"/>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <Grid Margin="20,16">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8B7;"/></Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="下载目录" FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding OutDir}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding OutDir}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button x:Name="BtnSettingsBrowse" Content="浏览…"/>
                                            <Button x:Name="BtnSettingsOpenDir" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE8A7;" Margin="6,0,0,0" ToolTip="打开目录"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource DividerLine}"/>
                                    <Grid Margin="20,16">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE945;"/></Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="同时下载数量" FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="同时进行的下载任务数（1–8）" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource SegmentHost}">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                <Button x:Name="BtnConcurrencyDown" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE738;" Width="30" Height="28" FontSize="11"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Concurrency}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Width="32" TextAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                <Button x:Name="BtnConcurrencyUp" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE710;" Width="30" Height="28" FontSize="11"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource DividerLine}"/>
                                    <Grid Margin="20,16">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE774;"/></Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="优先下载源" FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="解析或下载失败时自动回退到另一个源" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource SegmentHost}">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                <RadioButton x:Name="PrioMojang" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Prio" Content="Mojang 官方"/>
                                                <RadioButton x:Name="PrioBmclapi" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Prio" Content="BMCLAPI 镜像"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="个性化"/>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <Grid Margin="20,16">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE706;"/></Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="主题模式" FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="选择浅色、深色，或跟随 Windows 设置" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource SegmentHost}">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                                <RadioButton x:Name="ThemeLight" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Theme" Tag="light" Content="浅色"/>
                                                <RadioButton x:Name="ThemeDark" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Theme" Tag="dark" Content="深色"/>
                                                <RadioButton x:Name="ThemeSystem" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" GroupName="Theme" Tag="system" Content="跟随系统"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource DividerLine}"/>
                                    <Grid Margin="20,16">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Style="{StaticResource IconBox}"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE790;"/></Border>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Text="主题色" FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="用于按钮、选中状态、进度条与首页横幅" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ItemsControl x:Name="AccentList" Grid.Column="2" ItemsSource="{Binding Accents}" Focusable="False" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                                <ItemsPanelTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate>
                                                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource Swatch}" Background="{Binding Brush}" Tag="{Binding Key}"
                                                                 IsChecked="{Binding IsSelected, Mode=OneTime}" ToolTip="{Binding Name}"/>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Text="关于"/>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                                <Grid>
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <Border Width="52" Height="52" CornerRadius="13" Background="{DynamicResource HeroBg}" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE7B8;" FontSize="24" Foreground="White"/>
                                    </Border>
                                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="18,0,0,0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="MC 原版下载器" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="版本 2.0 · 基于 .NET Framework 4.x 与 WPF，无需额外运行库" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,14,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}" LineHeight="21">
                                            版本清单与文件来自 Mojang 官方源（piston-meta.mojang.com）与 BMCLAPI 镜像（bmclapi2.bangbang93.com，由 BangBang93 维护）。镜像只代理文件分发，下载后仍按官方 SHA1 校验。下载或使用 Minecraft 客户端即表示你同意 Mojang 的最终用户许可协议。
                                        </TextBlock>
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,12,0,0">
                                            <Hyperlink NavigateUri="https://aka.ms/MinecraftEULA">Minecraft EULA</Hyperlink>
                                            <Run Text="   ·   " Foreground="{DynamicResource TextTertiary}"/>
                                            <Hyperlink NavigateUri="https://bmclapidoc.bangbang93.com/">BMCLAPI 文档</Hyperlink>
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Grid>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>

                    <!-- ===== 通知 ===== -->
                    <Border x:Name="Toast" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,0,28"
                            Background="{DynamicResource CardBg}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardBorder}" BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="10" Padding="16,12" Visibility="Collapsed" MaxWidth="640">
                        <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="24" ShadowDepth="4" Opacity="0.22"/></Border.Effect>
                        <Border.RenderTransform><TranslateTransform x:Name="ToastShift"/></Border.RenderTransform>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <Border x:Name="ToastIconBox" Width="26" Height="26" CornerRadius="13">
                                <TextBlock x:Name="ToastIcon" Style="{StaticResource Icon}" FontSize="13"/>
                            </Border>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ToastText" Margin="12,0,4,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="560" FontSize="13"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <!-- ===== 对话框 ===== -->
            <Grid x:Name="DialogOverlay" Grid.RowSpan="2" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Background="{DynamicResource OverlayBg}" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <Border Width="440" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="12"
                        Background="{DynamicResource CardBg}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CardBorder}" BorderThickness="1">
                    <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="32" ShadowDepth="6" Opacity="0.3"/></Border.Effect>
                    <StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Margin="26,24,26,22">
                            <TextBlock x:Name="DialogTitle" FontSize="19" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="DialogText" Margin="0,12,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}" LineHeight="21"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Border Background="{DynamicResource LayerBg}" CornerRadius="0,0,11,11" Padding="26,18" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Divider}" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0">
                            <UniformGrid Columns="2">
                                <Button x:Name="DialogCancel" Content="取消" Margin="0,0,5,0" MinHeight="34"/>
                                <Button x:Name="DialogOk" Style="{StaticResource DangerButton}" Margin="5,0,0,0" MinHeight="34"/>
                            </UniformGrid>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>
    </Border>
</Window>
